---
import {moneyPence} from '../lib/tax-view';
import {CURRENT_YEAR,yearLabel} from '../lib/council-tax';
import {longDate} from '../lib/sources';
import {glaDecision} from '../lib/gla';
interface Props {region:string;gss:string}
const {region,gss}=Astro.props;
// Only for the same year as the area charge above (src/lib/gla.ts, C6).
const gla=glaDecision(CURRENT_YEAR);
const city=gss==='E09000001';
---
{gla && region==='London' && <section class="section" id="mayoral-precept" aria-labelledby="mayoral-heading"><h2 id="mayoral-heading">The mayoral precept in this bill</h2><div class="editorial-callout"><p>For {yearLabel(gla.year)}, the Greater London Authority's published Band D precept here is <strong>{moneyPence(city?gla.bands.D.cityOfLondon:gla.bands.D.boroughs)}</strong>. It is already included in the area charge above; do not add it again.</p>{city?<p>The City of London is outside the Metropolitan Police District. The GLA police element does not apply here.</p>:<p>This includes {moneyPence(gla.bands.D.policeIncludedInBoroughs)} for the police element and {moneyPence(gla.bands.D.nonPoliceIncluded)} for non-police services. Fire services sit within the GLA arrangements, so an extra standalone fire precept must not be added to this total.</p>}<p class="source-line">Source: <a href={gla.source.url}>{gla.source.publisher}, {gla.source.title}</a>, approved {longDate(gla.source.published)}. This breakdown is Band D only.</p></div></section>}
